Relationship:

For each UseAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of &#x27;performedBy’ on the from and a /Core/Agent class or subclass on the to.

For each UseAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of &#x27;affects’ on the from and a /Core/Element class or subclass on the to.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
